@startuml
title State diagram of the system operations of "Alarm Clock"

[*] --> Off

state "Off" as Off
state "Activated" as Activated
state "Ringing" as Ringing

Off --> Activated : set alarm time
ActivatedRoute --> Activated : set alarm time while already activated
Activated --> Ringing : current time matches set alarm time
Ringing --> Activated : next scheduled alarm time
Ringing --> Off : stop alarm
Activated or Ringing --> Off : turn off the alarm

Off --> [*] : no more alarms

@enduml
